### T1 eval force push, trailing <bs>
    cmd='eval "git push --force origin x" \\'
    want=deny (zsh drops the trailing backslash)
    p9-dev=deny  old-dev=ask  p9-stab=deny  old-stab=ask
    reason(p9-dev): git push --force rewrites or deletes remote history — the owner runs that by hand
